  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "sdc02_0140_dragonbb_01",
      "hash64": "955F413F66301C89",
      "text": "Yo, Champ in the making.[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "sdc02_0140_dragonbb_02",
      "hash64": "955F3E3F66301770",
      "text": "Sorry for the holdup. I’m back.[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 31,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "sdc02_0140_dragonbb_03",
      "hash64": "955F3F3F66301923",
      "text": "That’s one Elite Four member beat. Things are\\nlookin’ good for you![VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 67,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "sdc02_0140_dragonbb_a_01",
      "hash64": "686737BEAB875411",
      "text": "Crispin’s no pushover—he’s just super\\nstraightforward.[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 54,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "sdc02_0140_dragonbb_a_02",
      "hash64": "686734BEAB874EF8",
      "text": "I think that’s kinda part of his charm, y’know?[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 47,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "sdc02_0140_dragonbb_a_03",
      "hash64": "686735BEAB8750AB",
      "text": "We used to all chow down on Crispin’s cooking\\nafter club activities let out. Those were the days.[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 97,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "sdc02_0140_dragonbb_a_04",
      "hash64": "68673ABEAB87592A",
      "text": "Guess he’s been worrying about the way things\\nare, too, in his own way.[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 71,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "sdc02_0140_dragonbb_b_01",
      "hash64": "0F3277A564362D9E",
      "text": "Amarys sure leaves an impression, huh?[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 38,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "sdc02_0140_dragonbb_b_02",
      "hash64": "0F3276A564362BEB",
      "text": "It’s wild seeing her and Carmine talk. You’d never\\nguess it, but they click in a weird way. It’s pretty\\r\\nfunny to watch.[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 103,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 122,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "sdc02_0140_dragonbb_b_03",
      "hash64": "0F3275A564362A38",
      "text": "The thing about Amarys is, as rigid as she looks,\\nshe’s got a sensitive streak a mile wide.[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "sdc02_0140_dragonbb_b_04",
      "hash64": "0F327CA56436361D",
      "text": "Remember that about her, OK? Even if it’s hard\\nto tell from outside.[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 68,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "sdc02_0140_dragonbb_c_01",
      "hash64": "652B23ACFF42E933",
      "text": "Lacey’s all about cuteness—and that’s what helps\\nher make her Pokémon stronger.[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 79,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "sdc02_0140_dragonbb_c_02",
      "hash64": "652B24ACFF42EAE6",
      "text": "She’s so into her team, training the little cuties\\ndoesn’t even feel like work to her. Wild, right?[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 99,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "sdc02_0140_dragonbb_c_03",
      "hash64": "652B25ACFF42EC99",
      "text": "I bet it’s the same for you, huh? You work so hard\\nat it ’cause you like it![VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 76,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "sdc02_0140_dragonbb_c_04",
      "hash64": "652B26ACFF42EE4C",
      "text": "Unlike a certain someone who seems busy\\nrunning himself and everyone around him into\\r\\nthe ground just to get a bit stronger.[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 84,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 126,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "sdc02_0140_dragonbb_c_05",
      "hash64": "652B27ACFF42EFFF",
      "text": "Y’know, Lacey’s polite to everyone else, but\\nshe’s really blunt with me... I wonder why?[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "sdc02_0140_dragonbb_d_01",
      "hash64": "36C22394F24E3F60",
      "text": "Here’s your reward, like I said.[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 32,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "sdc02_0140_dragonbb_d_02",
      "hash64": "36C22694F24E4479",
      "text": "Guess I should’ve cleaned it, but what’s a little\\ndust between friends?[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 71,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "sdc02_0140_dragonbb_04",
      "hash64": "955F443F663021A2",
      "text": "You just might be the one we need to shake\\nthings up in the League Club.[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 72,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "sdc02_0140_dragonbb_05",
      "hash64": "955F453F66302355",
      "text": "That’s it from me.[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "sdc02_0140_dragonbb_06",
      "hash64": "955F423F66301E3C",
      "text": "Good luck with the remaining Elite Three.[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 41,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
